    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {"@context":"http://schema.org","@graph":[{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"United Airlines","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/united-airlines"},"datePublished":"2026-07-02T16:01:00.216Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/united-airlines_the-devil-wears-prada-2-now-on-board-united-activity-7478477839068016640-l-I2","text":"Look who just boarded. 👠\n\nThe Devil Wears Prada 2 is now exclusively playing on board United flights one month before any other airline. That's all.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/united-airlines_the-devil-wears-prada-2-now-on-board-united-activity-7478477839068016640-l-I2"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"United Airlines","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/united-airlines"},"datePublished":"2026-07-01T16:59:43.445Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/united-airlines_showing-our-pride-last-month-in-chicago-and-activity-7478130228767256578-Kg7l","text":"Showing our Pride last month in Chicago and New York City!\n\nLed by our LGBTQ+ Business Resource Group EQUAL, we support and celebrate LGBTQ+ employees with volunteer events and community-building initiatives all year long, like representing United in parades across 10 cities this year.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/united-airlines_showing-our-pride-last-month-in-chicago-and-activity-7478130228767256578-Kg7l"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"United Airlines","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/united-airlines"},"datePublished":"2026-06-30T17:11:40.892Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/united-airlines_our-newest-united-volunteer-prince-harry-activity-7477770850017140736-OQV8","text":"Our newest United volunteer, Prince Harry, joined our employees to serve up BBQ to the athletes and families at the Warrior Games, an annual event that brings together more than 200 wounded, ill or injured service members to compete in adaptive sports as part of their recovery journeys.\n\nThrough United4Veterans, our veterans business resource group, and our long-time partnership with Fisher House, our volunteers were on the ground in San Antonio to help make this year's celebration a success.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/united-airlines_our-newest-united-volunteer-prince-harry-activity-7477770850017140736-OQV8"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"United Airlines","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/united-airlines"},"datePublished":"2026-06-29T16:27:28.922Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/united-airlines_our-favorite-phrase-new-routes-activity-7477397338995601408-M0UZ","text":"Our favorite phrase: New routes. 😍💬  \n \nOur two new routes flying from Houston (IAH) and Washington Dulles (IAD) to Cartagena, Colombia will both take off 4x weekly starting December 17. Joining Bogota and Medellín, Cartagena is our third destination in Colombia.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/united-airlines_our-favorite-phrase-new-routes-activity-7477397338995601408-M0UZ"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"United Airlines","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/united-airlines"},"datePublished":"2026-06-24T20:04:24.878Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/united-airlines_solar-eclipse-activity-7475639992564912128-WdpI","text":"\"I'm out of the office for a celestial event\" —Your OOO notification on August 12\n\nWe fly to all of these full and partial eclipse destinations. Which one did you land on?\n","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/united-airlines_solar-eclipse-activity-7475639992564912128-WdpI"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"United Airlines","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/united-airlines"},"datePublished":"2026-06-23T16:24:32.011Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/united-airlines_pretty-sure-this-keeps-us-covered-livestream-activity-7475222269783429120-VXrR","text":"Pretty sure this keeps us covered. 😉\n\nLivestream matches during the *unnamed global sporting event* right from your seatback screen for FREE via DIRECTV on select flights equipped with high-speed Wi-Fi from Starlink. ","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/united-airlines_pretty-sure-this-keeps-us-covered-livestream-activity-7475222269783429120-VXrR"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"United Airlines","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/united-airlines"},"datePublished":"2026-06-22T18:56:22.905Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/united-airlines_our-rollout-of-the-worlds-fastest-most-activity-7474898095781322752-Zyjx","text":"Our rollout of the world's fastest, most reliable high-speed Wi-Fi in the sky is reaching far and w i d e.\n\nStarlink is now on board our first 777-200. International travelers can look forward to staying connected from gate to gate, even at 35,000 ft. over the ocean. And it's free for MileagePlus members.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/united-airlines_our-rollout-of-the-worlds-fastest-most-activity-7474898095781322752-Zyjx"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"United Airlines","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/united-airlines"},"datePublished":"2026-06-19T15:03:41.107Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/united-airlines_weve-been-telling-you-for-months-how-game-changing-activity-7473752372155039744-80Sj","text":"We've been telling you for months how game-changing Starlink is. \nNow it's *their* turn.\n\nWe asked real customers for their reviews of the world's fastest, most reliable high-speed inflight Wi-Fi, free for MileagePlus members.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/united-airlines_weve-been-telling-you-for-months-how-game-changing-activity-7473752372155039744-80Sj"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"United Airlines","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/united-airlines"},"datePublished":"2026-06-18T16:04:18.948Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/united-airlines_this-is-how-you-show-up-for-your-dad-when-activity-7473405242500448257-Q9eU","text":"This is how you show up for your dad.\n\nWhen ALS stopped Captain Rob L. from flying professionally, nothing could stop his son, First Officer Daniel L., from being in that flight deck for his dad's retirement flight.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/united-airlines_this-is-how-you-show-up-for-your-dad-when-activity-7473405242500448257-Q9eU"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"United Airlines","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/united-airlines"},"datePublished":"2026-06-17T20:16:24.778Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/united-airlines_one-of-the-things-our-airline-is-proudest-activity-7473106296964255744-ENS1","text":"One of the things our airline is proudest of is how loyal our customers are. Last year, a group of MileagePlus members decided to fly to all seven of our U.S. hubs in just one day.\n \nWe brought it back for year 2! The 2026 7 Hub Run flew 57 customers across the country in less than 24 hours: EWR→IAD →ORD→IAH→DEN→LAX→SFO 🙌","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/united-airlines_one-of-the-things-our-airline-is-proudest-activity-7473106296964255744-ENS1"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"United Airlines","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/united-airlines","address":{"type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"233 South Wacker Drive","addressLocality":"Chicago","addressRegion":"IL","postalCode":"60606","addressCountry":"US"},"description":"This is the story of airline that leads the industry from ground to clouds. Our global cast of over 100,000+ hero characters are each on a journey to be a force for good for our customers, the planet and each other. Come be part of this story.","numberOfEmployees":{"value":75663,"@type":"QuantitativeValue"},"logo":{"contentUrl":"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C560BAQE2FQDbKOgfJQ/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1652708216669/united_airlines_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=_mXaonOlmFhtXGu-yV5GMUn8eYM3qEj6g5ivrVTwJ4g","description":"United Airlines","@type":"ImageObject"},"sameAs":"http://united.com/careers"}]}
    </script>
  
  
      
