  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        attributed-text-segment-list__content-truncated" dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Our newest United volunteer, Prince Harry, joined our employees to serve up BBQ to the athletes and families at the Warrior Games, an annual event that brings together more than 200 wounded, ill or injured service members to compete in adaptive sports as part of their recovery journeys.

Through United4Veterans, our veterans business resource group, and our long-time partnership with Fisher House, our volunteers were on the ground in San Antonio to help make this year's celebration a success.</p>
          
            
                  
    

