        attributed-text-segment-list__content-truncated" dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">One of the things our airline is proudest of is how loyal our customers are. Last year, a group of MileagePlus members decided to fly to all seven of our U.S. hubs in just one day.
 
We brought it back for year 2! The 2026 7 Hub Run flew 57 customers across the country in less than 24 hours: EWR→IAD →ORD→IAH→DEN→LAX→SFO 🙌</p>
          
            
                  
    

